From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 18:43:32 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] webapi: apply CSS transforms to visual box geometry

Compose planar transforms and box-relative origins using DOMMatrix helpers. Keep layout metrics untransformed; align client rectangles, quad hit testing and document overflow. Track cascaded transforms with owned CSSOM strings and mutation invalidation. Preserve the untransformed hit-testing fast path and SVG syntax. Update existing position assertions.

Targets transformed-text-geometry without a native renderer. Upstream tests: 1658/1658; ignored geometry diagnostics: 26/26. Full 3D/perspective and complete CSS layout remain out of scope.
---
